_h('''SOME TIPS TO GET WELL IN INTERVIEW'''),
_p('''Here are some tips that must be followed during the course of interview:'''),
_s('''1. Preparing For The Interview:'''),
_p('''Before going to the interview, make sure you have accurately completed all of the paperwork. The interviews will be reviewing the information you have listed. It looks better if you type all of the information.'''),
_p('''You should review the questions you believe you will be asked as well as your answers to those questions. You want to look your best and sound your best.'''),
_s('''2. Physical Fitness:'''),
_p('''Physical fitness is very important in military so you must pass the physical agility test to move forward in the selection process. The combination of running, push-up and sit-ups are the best way to prepare for the test.'''),
_s('''3. Be In Time:'''),
_p('''Arrive there about 15 minutes early. It shows your regard for the interviewer's time. If you have to wait, use the time to go over your notes.'''),
_s('''4. Looking You Best:'''),
_p('''The most interviewers will expect a man to wear a suit and tie, and a woman to wear a dress or a business suit to the interview. Most of the time, an interviewing panel is prohibited from disqualifying an applicant based on what he or she is wearing. You want to project a professional image. You want to show the panel that you are a confident person.'''),
_s('''5. Be Enthusiastic, But Be Sincere:'''),
_p('''Be confident in your capabilities and show that you are interested in joining their department.'''),
_s('''6. Be Honest:'''),
_p('''Honesty and integrity are the main qualities to becoming a police officer. If you do not already possess these qualities, do not bother applying.'''),
_s('''7. Don't Cross Your Arms Or Legs:'''),
_p('''You have probably already heard you shouldn't cross your arms as it might make you seem defensive or guarded. This goes for your legs too. Keep your arms and legs open.'''),
_s('''8. Have Eye Contact, But Don't Stare:'''),
_p('''If there are several people you are talking to, give them all some eye contact to create a better connection and see if they are listening. Keeping too much eye-contact might creep people out. Giving no eye-contact might make you seem insecure. If you are'''),
