_s('''Dress, Appearance, Behaviour and Etiquettes:'''),
_n('''1. Dress of a person is certainly a pointer to his personality. Your dress should be properly fitted and nicely pressed. Hair should be cut. Clothes need not be gaudy and expensive. Your shoes be polished and cleaned.'''),
_n('''2. Before entering the interview room just knock at the door. When called-in, greet the interviewing officer. Don't offer your hand for handshake.'''),
_n('''3. Don't take seat unless you are asked by the officer and thank him after taking seat.'''),
_n('''4. Be natural and set-comfortably and need not be stiff.'''),
