_n('''6. If you have not understood the question get it clarified.'''),
_n('''7. Your speech should be natural (neither loud and not slow). Speak clearly and confidently.'''),
_n('''8. Give due respect to interviewing officer. Be polite and clear in your language.'''),
_n('''9. Your answers should be brief and to the point.'''),
